{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-point-of-sale-managing-terminals","reason":"Full independent review verified the pinned raw SHA-256, all five exact quotes and locations, and both fixed-query answers. The source accurately preserves store assignment before boarding, receipt and weekly security inspections, in-person scope, and the distinction between fleet administration and Terminal API payment messaging. One central retrieval route is mis-scoped: the candidate tells a fleet-management reader to start at the existing POS store-management concept, whose definition and sources concern store creation, status, payment methods and Management API store operations. Its proposed reciprocal link would make that store hub the primary fleet route while a dedicated terminal-management hub is being prepared."}
